{
  "id": "1208",
  "title": "Why Get Angry at Me?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2024-09-01",
  "synopsis": "Who got the numbers wrong at the office?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1208/e64702d23631ad0683dbb4bfe4456fd2e13c24e4.mp3?1614334939",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "为什么对我发火？\n\n小张：今天王总好像心情不错。\n小何：为什么？\n小张：因为我把数据弄错了，她都没有对我发火。\n小何：啊？\n小张：怎么了？\n小何：她以为是我做的，刚才对我发火了。",
    "traditional": "為什麼對我發火？\n\n小張：今天王總好像心情不錯。\n小何：為什麼？\n小張：因為我把數據弄錯了，她都沒有對我發火。\n小何：啊？\n小張：怎麼了？\n小何：她以為是我做的，剛才對我發火了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Why Get Angry at Me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：今天王总好像心情不错。",
      "traditional": "小張：今天王總好像心情不錯。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng jīn tiān wáng zǒng hǎo xiàng xīn qíng bú cuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Chief Wang seems to be in a pretty good mood today."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：为什么？",
      "traditional": "小何：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：因为我把数据弄错了，她都没有对我发火。",
      "traditional": "小張：因為我把數據弄錯了，她都沒有對我發火。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng yīn wèi wǒ bǎ shù jù nòng cuò le tā dōu méi yǒu duì wǒ fā huǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Because I got some numbers wrong, and she didn’t get angry at me at all."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：啊？",
      "traditional": "小何：啊？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ah?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小張：怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: What’s up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：她以为是我做的，刚才对我发火了。",
      "traditional": "小何：她以為是我做的，剛才對我發火了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé tā yǐ wéi shì wǒ zuò de gāng cái duì wǒ fā huǒ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: She thought I did it, and was angry at me just now."
    }
  ],
